  m_Text: 'AN = Access Node (switch). CN = Core Node (router). Rack order is not
    cosmetic: power at the top, away from data; patch panel directly above the switch
    it feeds; router below the switch it uplinks to; and the heavy box lowest for
    center of gravity.'
